 discovery, zenoh transport, multiaddr format, static peer config, dashboard access.\\\"\\ntriggers:\\n  - \\\"exo cluster\\\"\\n  - \\\"distributed inference\\\"\\n  - \\\"multi-node AI\\\"\\n  - \\\"zenoh peer\\\"\\n  - \\\"static peers\\\"\\n  - \\\"cross-subnet discovery\\\"\\n  - \\\"AI clus...","duration_ms":16,"error_message":null,"is_error":false,"result_preview":"{\"success\": true, \"message\": \"Skill 'distributed-inference' created.\", \"path\": \"research/distributed-inference\", \"skill_md\": \"/Users/davec/.hermes/skills/research/distributed-inference/SKILL.md\", \"_change\": {\"description\": \"Set up, configure, and troubleshoot distributed AI inference clusters across multiple Macs (EXO, etc). Peer discovery, z\"}, \"category\": \"research\", \"hint\": \"To add reference files, templates, or scripts, use skill_manage(action='write_file', name='distributed-inference', file_path='references/example.md', file_content='...')\"}","status":"ok","task_id":"59d27cf0-e617-4d2c-9fe5-cb07eae76688","tool_call_id":"call_8f9f3d4c89604b8a98b5a282","tool_name":"skill_manage","turn_id":"20260701_040209_4ee2de:59d27cf0-e617-4d2c-9fe5-cb07eae76688:daa5ff92"},"sessionId":"20260701_040209_4ee2de","timestamp":"2026-07-01T16:32:53.570108+00:00"},"type":"raw"},"obs_mr2aocws_cfe1369d6f2b":{"observation":{"hookType":"post_tool_call","id":"obs_mr2aocws_cfe1369d6f2b","raw":{"args_preview":"{\"name\":\"distributed-inference\",\"file_path\":\"references/exo-internals.md\"}","duration_ms":21,"error_message":null,"is_error":false,"result_preview":"{\"success\": true, \"name\": \"distributed-inference\", \"file\": \"references/exo-internals.md\", \"content\": \"# EXO Internals Reference\\n\\n## Strings Found in EXO.app Binary (EXO.app/Contents/MacOS/EXO)\\n\\n### Environment Variables\\n- `EXO_STATIC_PEERS` — comma-separated multiaddr-format peer addresses\\n- `EXO_LIBP2P_NAMESPACE` — namespace for discovery (may overlap with zenoh)\\n- `EXO_ENABLE_IMAGE_MODELS` — toggle for image model support\\n- `EXO_OFFLINE_MODE` — skip internet checks\\n\\n### Plist Keys (exolabs.EXO.plist)\\n- `EXOStaticPeers` — `\\\"ip4/10.1.2.7/tcp/50051\\\"` format (note: UI may show without leading `/`)\\n- `EXOEnableImageModels` — boolean\\n- `EXOOfflineMode` — boolean\\n- `EXOHFToken` — HuggingFace token for gated models\\n- `EXOCustomNamespace` — string (empty by default)\\n- `EXOOnboardingCompleted` — boolean\\n\\n### Internal Swift Properties\\n- `_staticPeers` / `_pendingStaticPeers` — SwiftUI state\\n- `_needsRestart` — flag set when config changes require restart\\n\\n## Source Layou...","status":"ok","task_id":"59d27cf0-e617-4d2c-9fe5-cb07eae76688","tool_call_id":"call_c01b116e762f4614a0459bde","tool_name":"skill_view","turn_id":"20260701_040209_4ee2de:59d27cf0-e617-4d2c-9fe5-cb07eae76688:daa5ff92"},"sessionId":"20260701_040209_4ee2de","timestamp":"2026-07-01T16:33:18.170201+00:00"},"type":"raw"},"obs_mr2aorv7_0866871c3e83":{"observation":{"hookType":"post_tool_call","id":"obs_mr2aorv7_0866871c3e83","raw":{"args_preview":"{\"action\":\"add\",\"content\":\"EXO distributed inference cluster setup: Two Mac machines - mini (10.1.2.7) and pro (10.1.1.9). EXO source code and venv at /Volumes/AI/exo/ (built from source, v0.3.70). EXO.app installed at /Applications/EXO.app on both machines. Static peers configured via ~/Library/Preferences/exolabs.EXO.plist (key: EXOStaticPeers, value format: /ip4/<ip>/tcp/<port>). Runtime reads EXO_STATIC_PEERS env var. Peer port visible in EXO settings UI. zenoh transport layer (transitioned ...","duration_ms":4,"error_message":null,"is_error":false,"result_preview":"{\"success\": true, \"done\": true, \"target\": \"user\", \"usage\": \"84% — 1,156/1,375 chars\", \"entry_count\": 3, \"message\": \"Entry added.\", \"note\": \"Write saved. This update is complete — do not repeat it.\"}","status":"ok","task_id":"59d27cf0-e617-4d2c-9fe5-cb07eae76688","tool_call_id":"call_0578af152474469da7cae4c5","tool_name":"memory","turn_id":"2026