8.88.x via en0)\\n- Pro has only 18GB total RAM, runs heavily compressed. Frequent process pruning needed.\\n\\n**Apps:**\\n- Dev build: `/Volumes/AI/exo/app/EXO/build/Build/Products/Release/EXO.app` (v1.0.1)\\n- Publ...","duration_ms":1,"error_message":"Memory at 1,156/1,375 chars. Adding this entry (1166 chars) would exceed the limit. Consolidate now: use 'replace' to merge overlapping entries into shorter ones or 'remove' stale or less important entries (see current_entries below), then retry this add — all in this turn.","is_error":true,"result_preview":"{\"success\": false, \"error\": \"Memory at 1,156/1,375 chars. Adding this entry (1166 chars) would exceed the limit. Consolidate now: use 'replace' to merge overlapping entries into shorter ones or 'remove' stale or less important entries (see current_entries below), then retry this add — all in this turn.\", \"current_entries\": [\"Prefers using the `mcp-router` MCP tool (via MCP Router app) for external service queries like Redmine, rather than attempting local CLI commands or generic web searches.\", \"Prefers **class-level / umbrella names** for new skills over session- or domain-specific names. When designing a new skill, widen the name (e.g., `projects` not `cnc-projects`, `systematic-debugging` not `debug-xyz-today`). A skill should only be narrow when the domain itself is narrow (openhue, touchdesigner-mcp). If you notice two existing skills that overlap, flag it — curator consolidates.\", \"EXO distributed inference cluster setup: Two Mac machines - mini (10.1.2.7) and pro (10.1.1.9). EXO...","status":"error","task_id":"8126e739-e83e-42d2-824a-87f679d7f1d8","tool_call_id":"call_function_7751xmin0d35_1","tool_name":"memory","turn_id":"20260701_040209_4ee2de:8126e739-e83e-42d2-824a-87f679d7f1d8:b8749413"},"sessionId":"20260701_040209_4ee2de","timestamp":"2026-07-01T19:16:00.246805+00:00"},"type":"raw"},"obs_mr2gj9tn_925732794b7e":{"observation":{"hookType":"post_tool_call","id":"obs_mr2gj9tn_925732794b7e